= Paper 2
{scope}

These are original worked solutions. The source paper occupies physical pages 131–137 of the released bundle, with questions on pages 132–137. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/past_exam_information_of_nst_ib_2/response/3538005/attach/2/FOI%202026%20642%20Cui%20materials%20Part1.pdf?cookie_passthrough=1#page=131[University of Cambridge release, physical pages 131–137]{ref}

